    "about": "Pantai Panorama Condominiums is a freehold condominium development located in Kampung Kerinchi (Bangsar South), Kuala Lumpur. This high-rise development is superbly placed in the prime location of Bangsar South, a self-sufficient and thriving neighbourhood. Pantai Panorama Condominiums was completed in the year 1996 and was developed by Amcorp Properties Berhad. It contains 5 blocks of the 18-storey residential tower. There is a total of 708 residential units in this development with the built-up area starting from 750 to 1,300 sq ft. Recreational and leisure facilities are also available for enjoyment. These facilities include a swimming pool, wading pool, badminton hall, BBQ area, gymnasium room, sauna, spa pool, squash court, tennis courts and children's playground. Other than that, this unique development comes with a covered car park and a 24-hour security system as well. Bangsar South is also well-known for its nightlife offerings as plenty of bars, cafés, restaurants and other nightlife hotspots could be found around the area. Other than that, it also features top shopping destinations like KL Gateway Mall ( 650m ), Nexus Bangsar South ( 800m ), The Sphere ( 1km ), Mid Valle",
